---
pagination:
  data: courses
  size: 1
  alias: course
layout: page.njk
permalink: "{{ course.id }}.html"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ course.title }}"
---
<p class="eyebrow">WORKSHOP GUIDE AND PRACTICALS</p>
<h1>{{ course.title }}</h1>
<p class="lead">{{ course.description }}</p>
<p>Read from top to bottom. Parts 1–5 explain the ideas, the data and the code. Part 6 then works through the analysis one step at a time: each step explains the method, gives a short exercise for each idea, shows how to run the full stage and ends with a hands-on practical on the real data.</p>
<p><a href="setup.html">Set up RStudio once</a> · <a href="downloads.html">Get the combined project</a></p>
<h2 id="practicals">Hands-on practicals in this guide</h2>
<ol class="practical-list">
{% for practical in course.practicals %}
<li><a href="{{ practical.href }}">{{ practical.title }}</a> <small>{{ practical.target }}</small></li>
{% endfor %}
</ol>

<div class="guide">
{% for segment in course | guideSegments %}
{% if segment.type == "html" %}{{ segment.html | safe }}
{% elif segment.type == "lesson" %}{% set lesson = segment.lesson %}{% include "lesson-section.njk" %}
{% elif segment.type == "practical" %}{% set practical = segment.practical %}{% include "practical-section.njk" %}
{% elif segment.type == "stage" %}{% set stage = segment.stage %}{% include "stage-section.njk" %}
{% elif segment.type == "preview" %}{% include "preview-section.njk" %}
{% elif segment.type == "helpers" %}{% include "helpers-section.njk" %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
</div>
